WEBVTT

00:11:26.167 --> 00:11:31.768
I would recommend that the West
adopt a new "three-m" strategy:

00:11:31.792 --> 00:11:36.750
minimalist, multilateral
and Machiavellian.

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:38.851
(Laughter)

00:11:38.875 --> 00:11:40.476
Why minimalist?

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:44.809
Now even though
Western domination has ended,

00:11:44.833 --> 00:11:48.809
the West continues to intervene
and interfere in the affairs

00:11:48.833 --> 00:11:50.684
of many other societies.

00:11:50.708 --> 00:11:52.309
This is unwise.

00:11:52.333 --> 00:11:55.018
This is generating anger and resentment,

00:11:55.042 --> 00:11:57.351
especially in Islamic societies.

00:11:57.375 --> 00:12:03.309
It's also draining the resources
and spirits of Western societies.